        "original_id": "69b0e17f-8c4d-5a1c-974d-4a0ed3c84959",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Harrison, Ravi Shankar, the Beatles\n- Works: Dark Horse, \"Simply Shady\"\n- Events: North American tour, The Beatles' 1966 US tour\n- Places: North America, America\n\nFacts:\n- In August 1966, the Beatles staged their third concert tour of America, and it was the last commercial tour they ever undertook.\n- In November and December 1974, George Harrison staged a controversial North American tour with co-headliner Ravi Shankar.\n- In 1974, George Harrison released the album Dark Horse, which was keenly anticipated on release and became associated with the controversial North American tour.\n- In 1974, George Harrison released the song \"Simply Shady\" on his album Dark Horse.",
